# Milestone: v1.0-rc stdlib-completeness
# Covers: Kotlin-named Integer bitwise methods (and/or/xor/inv/shl/shr/ushr).
#
# Bitwise ops are NAMED methods (the `&` / `|` glyphs are concurrency
# separators).  Renamed from the M6 bit* set to the Kotlin set; ushr is
# the new unsigned (logical, shift masked to [0,63]) right shift.
6.and(3)
[00000000] 2
6.or(1)
[00000001] 7
6.xor(3)
[00000002] 5
0.inv()
[00000003] -1
1.shl(4)
[00000004] 16
16.shr(2)
[00000005] 4
(-1).ushr(60)
[00000006] 15
